Significance: minor
Type: removed

Charts: remove the `useTooltipPortalRelocator` hook and the `portalContainer` prop on `GlobalChartsProvider`. The relocator (added in #47118 / 0.56.4) caused tooltip glyphs and the tooltip box to drift away from the chart line by exactly the page scroll offset on scrolled pages. Consumers needing z-index isolation for tooltips against sticky headers should style `.visx-tooltip` (or its container) directly.
